Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.01,0:22:44.18,EDCHT2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}外面多麼豐富多彩（美麗）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.18,0:22:48.01,EDCHT2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}繽紛絢麗（美麗） 繽紛絢麗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.64,0:22:56.31,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}當月亮升起時 我打扮成一隻熊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.31,0:22:59.03,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}大家都是什麼樣的動物呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.03,0:23:04.28,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}我想要知道 真實的你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.78,0:23:09.41,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}大家聚在一起 軟綿綿的party
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.41,0:23:12.25,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}無論是小孩子還是大孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.25,0:23:16.58,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}ah 當你笑的時候 為我帶來了happy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.58,0:23:19.92,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}耳朵和尾巴都在搖晃 ho
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.92,0:23:21.67,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}毛茸 毛茸 ahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.67,0:23:23.47,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}驚喜 驚喜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.47,0:23:25.22,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}撫摸 撫摸 ahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.22,0:23:27.01,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}好癢 好癢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:28.64,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}毛茸 毛茸 ahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.64,0:23:30.43,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}驚喜 驚喜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.43,0:23:33.60,EDCHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur3}撫摸 撫摸 你是最棒的！
